Z||000012||Capt Fiero||02-11-2000||05:36 PM||||I do not know of where you are in Canada, but here at my Local Canadain Tire store they have just brought in a bunch of car custome stuff, includding Blue interior lights, A stock Fiero has 6 2 on the floor and 3 on the top headliner.  I replaced the 2 at the feet and the 2 in the center top with blue lights, if you open the doors the interior is blue at night, if you need light in the interior, you still have the 2 far right and far left lights on the headliner panel that you leave alone.  It really looks cool and the 4 bulbs only cost me 7.50 they were made by a company called Victor, pretty cool.<P>David <BR>Oh I also have the 8" blue light bars from Canadain tire, and I hate them, really not bright enough and I have them mounted into the suit hanger hooks just infront of the rear window.  ||||reg||1
